---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "安平丝网：中国丝网制造中心";
const description = "安平县生产中国 80% 的丝网。了解其产业集群、产品专业化、质量层级以及如何高效采购。";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <!-- Hero with Stats -->
  <section class="bg-theme-secondary border-b border-theme py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-theme-accent tracking-widest mb-3">INDUSTRY CLUSTER PROFILE</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-theme-primary">安平丝网</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-theme-secondary max-w-2xl mb-2">
        河北省安平县估计生产中国 80% 的丝网。
      </p>
      <p class="text-base text-theme-muted mb-8">
        世界丝网看中国，中国丝网看安平 —— 把一根丝织成 800 亿的产业带。
      </p>

      <!-- Key Stats Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-theme-accent">1.5万+</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1">集群企业数量</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">安平县全域分布</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-theme-accent">800亿+</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1">年产值</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">2025 年口径</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-theme-accent">60%</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1">出口占比</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">销往 60+ 国家地区</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-theme-accent">500<span class="text-lg">年</span></p>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary mt-1">产业沿革</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">始于明朝，丝网之乡</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 text-sm text-theme-muted">
    <a href="/zh/" class="hover:text-theme-accent">首页</a> / 安平丝网
  </nav>

  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <article class="flex-1 min-w-0">
    <!-- Overview -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">安平为何主导丝网产业</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        安平的丝网产业可追溯至明代，当时本地工匠为军队织造绢网。
        现代工业化生产始于 20 世纪 50 年代，并在改革开放后大幅扩张。
        如今该县拥有数千家注册丝网制造商，从小型作坊到大型出口导向工厂不等。
      </p>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        这种产业集聚为买家带来多项优势：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong class="text-theme-primary">完整供应链</strong> — 拉丝、编织、焊接、镀锌和 PVC 包塑全部在本地完成</li>
        <li><strong class="text-theme-primary">有竞争力的价格</strong> — 激烈的本地竞争使利润保持微薄</li>
        <li><strong class="text-theme-primary">产品多样性</strong> — 从 5 微米过滤网到重型矿筛</li>
        <li><strong class="text-theme-primary">出口基础设施</strong> — 许多工厂拥有 10 年以上出口经验</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Industrial Zones -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">主要产业集聚区</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        安平的丝网生产集中在几个乡镇，各有不同的专业化方向：
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">区域</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">专业化方向</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">工厂类型</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">安平镇（县城）</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">编织丝网、过滤网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">中到大型制造商</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">桃城乡镇</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">焊接丝网、护栏网片</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">规模混合，出口导向</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">河滨乡镇</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">镀锌丝、刺绳</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">拉丝专业厂</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">马庄乡镇</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">石笼网箱、六角网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">重型网材加工厂</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">经济开发区</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">高端不锈钢网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">规模较大、有认证的工厂</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Product Specialization Map -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">产品专业化分布</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        安平不同区域擅长不同产品。将需求与合适的专业化方向匹配，可提高质量并获得更好价格：
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">编织丝网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            传统优势产业。这里的工厂可生产从粗至 2 目筛网
            到超细 500 目滤布的各种产品。不锈钢和黄铜是
            常用材质。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">焊接丝网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            焊后镀锌和 PVC 包塑生产线集中在特定
            作坊。质量差异很大——大订单前请实地考察或验厂。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">护栏系统</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            3D 护栏网片、勾花网和尖桩栅栏的完整产业链。
            配件（立柱、卡扣、大门）通常来自邻近作坊。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">石笼与土工布</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            重型六角网编织和石笼组装。部分工厂为
            挡土墙项目提供设计协助。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Industry Chain -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">完整产业链</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        安平的优势在于完全本地化的供应链。每个生产环节都在县域内完成，缩短交货周期并实现快速定制：
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-4">
        <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-2">🔧</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary text-sm mb-1">拔丝</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">原材料 → 线材</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-2">🧵</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary text-sm mb-1">织网与焊接</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">网面成型</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-2">⚙️</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary text-sm mb-1">深加工</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">裁剪、成型、涂层</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
          <p class="text-2xl mb-2">🌍</p>
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary text-sm mb-1">外贸出口</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-theme-muted">物流、清关</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-theme-card border border-theme rounded-lg p-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
          <strong class="text-theme-primary">关键洞察：</strong>这种垂直整合意味着护栏板订单可在 15-20 天内从钢卷变成集装箱货物。
          对买家而言，这意味着更快的打样、更便捷的定制，以及比分散采购更低的协调成本。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Featured Factories -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">代表性工厂</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        按专业化分类的制造商样本。收录不代表背书。下单前请务必进行尽职调查。
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-3 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary">安平县宏宇丝网有限公司</h3>
                <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-green-500/20 text-green-400 border border-green-500/30">已验证</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted mb-2">不锈钢编织网 • 滤布 • 50-200 人</p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-theme-tertiary rounded text-theme-secondary">ISO 9001</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-theme-tertiary rounded text-theme-secondary">出口：美欧</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-theme-tertiary rounded text-theme-secondary">成立于 2005</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary">河北安平中泰护栏有限公司</h3>
                <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-green-500/20 text-green-400 border border-green-500/30">已验证</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted mb-2">焊接护栏板 • 3D 护栏 • 尖桩栅栏</p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-theme-tertiary rounded text-theme-secondary">ISO 9001</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-theme-tertiary rounded text-theme-secondary">出口：非洲、中东</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-theme-tertiary rounded text-theme-secondary">成立于 2010</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary">安平新华石笼网制造有限公司</h3>
                <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-yellow-500/20 text-yellow-400 border border-yellow-500/30">未验证</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted mb-2">石笼网 • 六角网 • 雷诺护垫</p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-theme-tertiary rounded text-theme-secondary">重型网</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-theme-tertiary rounded text-theme-secondary">项目支持</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-theme-tertiary rounded text-theme-secondary">成立于 2015</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 bg-theme-card">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary">安平县金丰丝网制品有限公司</h3>
                <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-yellow-500/20 text-yellow-400 border border-yellow-500/30">未验证</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-sm text-theme-muted mb-2">冲孔板 • 钢板网 • 钢格板</p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-theme-tertiary rounded text-theme-secondary">定制加工</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-theme-tertiary rounded text-theme-secondary">OEM</span>
                <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-theme-tertiary rounded text-theme-secondary">成立于 2012</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
          <strong class="text-theme-primary">免责声明：</strong>工厂信息由企业自行填报或来自公开记录。
          我们未对所有声明进行独立核实。大额订单前，请务必索取营业执照、实地考察，
          或使用第三方验货服务。
          <a href="/zh/factories/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline">查看完整目录 →</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Quality Tiers -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">质量层级</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        安平工厂分为不同的质量层级。了解您需要哪个层级，
        既能避免多花钱，也能避免质量事故：
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">层级</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">特征</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">适用场景</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme font-medium text-theme-primary">作坊</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">5-20 名工人，基础设备，质控有限</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">简单产品、价格敏感订单</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme font-medium text-theme-primary">小型工厂</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20-50 名工人，部分自动化，基础检测</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">标准产品，中小批量</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme font-medium text-theme-primary">中型工厂</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50-200 名工人，现代化产线，完整质控部门</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">出口订单、稳定质量要求</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme font-medium text-theme-primary">大型制造商</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">200+ 名工人，ISO 认证，具备研发能力</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">技术产品、长期合同、OEM</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-theme-tertiary border border-theme rounded-lg p-4 mb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
          <strong class="text-theme-primary">实用提示：</strong>安平许多贸易公司自称是工厂。
          这未必是坏事——优秀的贸易商通过质检和物流增加价值——
          但要知道自己支付的是什么。如果工厂直价对您很重要，
          请索要工厂注册文件和生产线照片。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Structured Procurement Guide -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">采购快速参考</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        安平常用产品的典型规格、价格区间和最低起订量。可作为评估报价的基准参考。
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm border-collapse">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">产品</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">典型规格</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">价格区间*</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">MOQ</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 border border-theme bg-theme-tertiary font-semibold text-theme-primary">交货期</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-primary font-medium">不锈钢编织网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">304/316，20-200 目</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$8-25/kg</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50-100 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">15-25 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-primary font-medium">镀锌焊接网</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">1/2"-4" 孔径，1-3mm 丝径</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$3-8/m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">500-1000 m²</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">10-20 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-primary font-medium">3D 护栏板</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">50×200mm，4mm 丝径，PVC 包塑</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$12-28/片</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">200-500 片</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">20-30 天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-theme">
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-primary font-medium">石笼网箱</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">2×1×1m，80×100mm 网孔</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">$15-35/个</td>
              <td class="p-3 border border-theme text-theme-secondary">100-500 个</td>
